        "name": "Guardian Rugby Union"
      }
    },
    "387": {
      "date": "2026-11-16",
      "edition": "Monday 16 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Cross-code invite",
          "heading": "Antoine Dupont invites Zinédine Zidane to Marcoussis; Zidane says it's no problem",
          "body": "Antoine Dupont has invited France football head coach Zinédine Zidane to Marcoussis, the France rugby training base, to compare notes on elite-level pressure, and Zidane has accepted. The France captain said the doors were wide open and that the two sports face the same problems at the top. Zidane replied that the exchange would be interesting and that arranging it would be no problem. Finding a common date is the next hurdle; France still have two Nations Championship games, one possibly a final at Twickenham."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Wales beat New Zealand 35-28, ending long wait for a win",
          "body": "England recall Furbank, Chessum and Atkinson for All Blacks clash. South Africa's Jesse Kriel signs on in Japan."
