    "389": {
      "date": "2026-11-16",
      "edition": "Monday 16 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Squad news",
          "heading": "Quesada retains Argentina match group, recalls Pani and invites Sette for Fiji",
          "body": "Italy head coach Gonzalo Quesada has kept the Argentina match group for the Fiji game, the final pool fixture, adding Lorenzo Pani back from a long injury layoff. Federico Zanandrea drops out. Davide Sette, Italy U20 captain in last week's win over France U20 in Parma, is invited to train with the squad, and Domingo Miotti is again named among the fly-halves. Italy lost 14-19 to Argentina in Genoa, and the matchday line-up is due Thursday."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Wales beat New Zealand 35-28, ending long wait for a win",
          "body": "England recall Furbank, Chessum and Atkinson for All Blacks clash. South Africa's Jesse Kriel signs on in Japan."
